<title>JAPAN: GOLF-LEADING FIRST ROUND SCORES IN CHUNICHI CROWNS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING FIRST ROUND SCORES IN CHUNICHI CROWNS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>NAGOYA, Japan 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>Thursday's first round of the $1 million Chunichi Crowns</p>
<p>tournament at the Nagoya Golf Club's Wago course (6,455-yard,</p>
<p>par-70).</p>
<p>(Japanese unless noted)</p>
<p>62 - Taichi Teshima</p>
<p>66 - David Smail (New Zealand), Masayuki Kawamura, Ikuo</p>
<p>Shirahama,</p>
<p>Greg Norman (Australia)</p>
<p>67 - Masashi Ozaki, Tateo Ozaki, Tsuyoshi Yoneyama, Brian Watts</p>
<p>(U.S.). Satoshi Higashi, Kaname Yokoo, Kazuhiro Takami,</p>
<p>Shinichi Yokota; Masatoshi Horikawa</p>
<p>68 - Rick Gibson (Canada), Koichi Suzuki, Steven Conran</p>
<p>(Australia),</p>
<p>Eiji Mizoguchi, Hiroshi Makino, Craig Stadler (U.S.).</p>
</text>
